repository-code: "https://github.com/JamesWeatherhead/CaseAttend"
url: "https://caseattend.com"
abstract: >-
  CaseAttend is an open-source, bring-your-own-key web application that teaches
  case-based visual reasoning across medical subspecialties (radiology,
  pathology, dermatology) by working through real images with a question-first
  AI tutor. It was selected as one of 50 winners out of 4,096 entries in the
  "Vibe Code with Gemini 3 Pro" Kaggle hackathon.
keywords:
  - medical education
  - radiology
  - pathology
  - dermatology
  - medical imaging
  - case-based learning
  - large language models
  - artificial intelligence
